\p{This section isolates a later inference and training intervention: the
retained-context rule, rollout horizon, runtime budget, and gradient estimator
may all change together. It therefore treats Prefix Sliding as an empirical
source-reported intervention, not as a capability or support theorem.}

\p{The finite cards below define the coordinates, prove only elementary
consequences under their stated hypotheses, and keep source observations and
transfer questions visibly separate.}

